<title>HONG KONG: Guangdong Tannery posts 1st final results.</title>
<headline>Guangdong Tannery posts 1st final results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   25</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  14.06 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    41.33</p>
<p>    Turnover		     305.64</p>
<p>    Company name		 Guangdong Tannery Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Guangdong Tannery, a leather spinoff of Guangdong Investment Ltd, was listed on the stock exchange on December 16, 1996.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain of HK$14.06 million representing interest income on application monies received on issue of new shares.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
